        "name": "USN-7443-3",
        "description": "USN-7443-1 fixed a vulnerability in Erlang. This update provides the corresponding update for Ubuntu 16.04 LTS and Ubuntu 18.04 LTS.  Original advisory details:   Fabian B\u00e4umer, Marcel Maehren, Marcus Brinkmann, and J\u00f6rg Schwenk  discovered that Erlang OTP\u2019s SSH module incorrect handled authentication. A  remote attacker could use this issue to execute arbitrary commands without  authentication, possibly leading to a system compromise.",
        "aliases": [
          "CVE-2025-32433"
        ]
      },
